{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6150fe1b-48d9-5cc3-b3cf-07d35fb794d3", "source_ordinal": 3343, "reading_ordinal": 709, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "女舰长", "published_at": "2021-05-07T21:26:01+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/323056260/answer/1873801330"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "抱歉，我相信中国军队治理的成果，胜过相信知乎网友的判断。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "基本不认为在现在的备战水平下解放军会把重要装备拿来儿戏。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一艘护卫舰舰队防空中的责任之重，要负责挡住第一线数十海里乃至上百海里的正面。如果力不胜任，等于整个舰队有一个方向露出胸膛给人捅。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这是什么样要害的后果？", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "海军在下水饺，扩军的时候资浅军官被提拔的概率自然大增，在人事任命上看似超常，其实这并没有那么奇怪。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为如果我们有六十条船，我们少说也要准备200-300名可以随时接替舰长职位的后备梯队。我敢断言现在是中国有史以来见习舰长与正式主官数量比例最悬殊的时期。", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "其比例之悬殊，恐怕不止前无古人，后也无来者。", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这甚至是一种对情报分析部门的微妙喊话，是在以事实的威慑传递信息给美军的战略参谋部门。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "“中国海军为什么会开始连半路出家的女博士都列入见习舰长的训练队列？”", "char_start": 329, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为我们要接手的军舰太多啊。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 378}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "三军都在积极提高战备水平，这个时候应该是全军最不会讲政治正确的时候，在现有的提拔考核机制和监察机制下，想要在没有充分实绩的前提下拿一艘军舰的主官职位去给“钻营”的人当走后门、而且还是女性、还打破了从军资历的记录——这超出了智商正常的人的水平。", "char_start": 379, "char_end": 500}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如果是出于贪污和请托，这是军委常委级别也压不住的案件。可以让你不显山不露水吃到水的地方何其之多，专门选显微镜正下方的位置，这是什么逻辑？", "char_start": 501, "char_end": 569}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "想坐牢没必要走这条路——出售军职是可能处死刑的。", "char_start": 570, "char_end": 594}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而且这与解放军现在的组织状态、战备强度在事实上不兼容。", "char_start": 595, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所以初步倾向于相信这背后有足够经得起质疑的合理性。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 648}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0118"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价韦慧晓放弃百万年薪，做了中国第一位实习女舰长？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "作者围绕“女舰长”展开正文论述；此为原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核深化。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出或陈述：“抱歉，我相信中国军队治理的成果，胜过相信知乎网友的判断。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文论述。", "其余推理步骤待逐段独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["正文论证、事实依据与概念边界需独立复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "抱歉，我相信中国军队治理的成果，胜过相信知乎网友的判断。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动的最低限度初读记录；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1282d90a-c2a2-5fa5-94c5-7b93be0881b5", "source_ordinal": 3342, "reading_ordinal": 710, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "羞愧", "published_at": "2021-05-08T13:45:05+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/28642580/answer/1874813027"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "假设对人类来说有一个恰当的羞愧度可言，那么在同样无法准确的掌握住这个度的前提下，偏向无羞愧感的人比较好，还是偏向更强羞愧感的人好？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "先说对别人而言哪个好——这不用说，当然是后者好。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 90}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "人是不喜欢与“羞愧迟钝”的人交往的，这样的人辜负别人没有任何感觉，违约没有任何焦虑，经过提醒也没有什么急迫的动力去改进——只要ta确信不改进不会导致关系断裂。", "char_start": 91, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "没了羞愧，违约对一个人唯一的问题就是可能会失去合作会吃亏，这样的话，为了保证你不违约，只好把你的保证金加一个0，免得你觉得无所谓。", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "深知你是知耻知羞的人，不会为了避免羞愧的痛苦而说“这有什么可耻的，别拿你的价值观往我身上套”这种话，那么你的保证金就会少一些——你房子都好租一些、工作都会好找点。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "够现实了吗？", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "没人会真的耐烦跟你辩解到底羞愧感是不是健康的，总之你自己没有羞愧可言，他也不会说不跟你交易，但肯定就提高点保证金要求保命。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 387}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你都没羞愧可言，不预先给保证金，只在合同里写违约金人家都不会放心。到时候找你要，你不给也一样没有羞愧感啊。没有羞愧感着什么急，等对方起诉再说呗。", "char_start": 388, "char_end": 460}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "看懂了吗？", "char_start": 461, "char_end": 466}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "没有羞愧感，不接受羞愧感的存在，必欲除之而后快的话，最小的代价也是社会生活成本飙升，造成大量信用损失。", "char_start": 467, "char_end": 518}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "但是羞愧的反对者们大概会说“但是这对你们好，但是对我自己不好，我不想莫名其妙的为什么东西羞愧”。", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 568}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你不想羞愧是可以理解的，谁喜欢多一些痛苦呢？没有谁是自我折磨爱好者。哪怕所谓“受虐狂”都不是——那是享受。", "char_start": 569, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "但是这事没这么简单。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 633}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "第一个，上面已经说了——这会妨碍你与别人建立关系。你不想为羞愧痛苦，那你想不想别人能进的你就进不去，别人能有的待遇你就没有？", "char_start": 634, "char_end": 696}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你不能两头都占。", "char_start": 697, "char_end": 705}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "第二个，羞愧是建立在你以某事为耻、以某事为义务的前提下的。不是建立在害怕这样不会讨人欢心的前提下的。", "char_start": 706, "char_end": 756}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "后者那不叫羞愧，那叫贪婪。", "char_start": 757, "char_end": 770}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这没有与前面那条矛盾——人家会因为你的羞愧自觉降低保证金要求，但是却根本不会为你害怕保证金提高而降低保证金啊。", "char_start": 771, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "为某事羞愧，是你在价值观上以某事为必须坚守的原则为前提的。你不以那些为必须坚守的原则，你当然不必也不会羞愧。", "char_start": 827, "char_end": 881}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "但是，那也意味着你不为某事羞愧，就是在否定这项原则。", "char_start": 882, "char_end": 908}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "某些原则，你否定了，别人就别无选择，只能对你敬而远之，连提高保证金都没有得谈。", "char_start": 909, "char_end": 948}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "比如得了人的好处没能给人回报，不论是不是对方自愿的，都应该羞愧。", "char_start": 949, "char_end": 981}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "是的，没人能要求你羞愧，但是你应该羞愧。", "char_start": 982, "char_end": 1002}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "只要你想不羞愧，你随时可以拿出“那是对方自愿的”来最完美的辩护，然后就可以摆脱这种痛苦了，人世间的一切法律都对你无可追究。", "char_start": 1003, "char_end": 1064}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "但是你还是应该羞愧。", "char_start": 1065, "char_end": 1075}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这不是一个责备，而是一个建议。", "char_start": 1076, "char_end": 1091}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你不会因为接受一种羞愧而变得比较可耻、比较低贱。", "char_start": 1092, "char_end": 1116}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "恰恰相反，你因为这种羞愧而变得更高贵了。", "char_start": 1117, "char_end": 1137}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这是这件事最诡异的地方——", "char_start": 1138, "char_end": 1151}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "拒绝羞愧的人不是在拒绝低贱，而是在拒绝高贵。", "char_start": 1152, "char_end": 1174}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 31}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0118"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何消除羞愧感?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030"], "summary": "作者围绕“羞愧”展开正文论述；此为原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核深化。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出或陈述：“假设对人类来说有一个恰当的羞愧度可言，那么在同样无法准确的掌握住这个度的前提下，偏向无羞愧感的人比较好，还是偏向更强羞愧感的人好？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文论述。", "其余推理步骤待逐段独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["正文论证、事实依据与概念边界需独立复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "假设对人类来说有一个恰当的羞愧度可言，那么在同样无法准确的掌握住这个度的前提下，偏向无羞愧感的人比较好，还是偏向更强羞愧感的人好？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动的最低限度初读记录；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a21a1ce4-7fee-5234-b662-8dc2545359cc", "source_ordinal": 3341, "reading_ordinal": 711, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "论语", "published_at": "2021-05-08T19:19:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/449306530/answer/1875399930"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "学而时习之，不亦说乎？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "什么叫“学”？", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "什么叫“习”？", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 27}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "为什么要说“时”？“习之”难道不比“时习之”好？", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“之”什么“之”？", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 62}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "为什么说“亦”？“亦”前面是什么才轮到它叫“亦”？", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "为什么不说“学而时习之，亦说”？为什么要用反问句？", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这是在反问谁？", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "为什么把这篇放开头？", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "回答一下，谢谢。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "《论语》的问题根本就不是《论语》到底是什么意思，而是《论语》符合了几个特殊的条件：", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "1）它的简略性使得它有很大的诠释空间，而它的浅显性又使得所有的诠释多少会有部分的共识。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 229}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "2）它所描述的规则和主张是一种属于“伦理公约数”的东西。", "char_start": 230, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "换句话来说，它兼有广阔、浅显、合理三个属性。", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 281}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "说一句话容易，在没有可模仿的对象的前提下，系统的给出同时有这三个属性的论述，难。", "char_start": 282, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这三个属性为什么至关重要？", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "因为它的广阔性保证了几乎任何人的政治主张都可以基于对它的诠释做出恰当的表达——我想搞精英政治，我可以通过诠释《论语》来主张这是圣人所言；我想搞民粹政治，我也可以说这是夫子原意——从而将两种互不相让的理念之争容纳到了这种学术之争的形式之中。", "char_start": 337, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而无论任何一方暂时的胜利，都不会导致经典本身的废弃。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "而它的浅显性又保证了无论你怎么诠释，你都有一个共识的定锚。即使是贩夫走卒、引车卖浆者流，只要会说中文，只要吃白米饭、牵老黄牛，就能获得一种免费的能力——人也许不知道精确的解释是什么，但是很容易知道荒谬的解释是什么——“你这样解释就不着调了”。", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 605}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这保证了无论你们的分歧有多大，斗争有多激烈，你们必然在极大的比例上存在“多党共识”，因为你们无法抛弃广大目不识丁的老百姓对这经典望文生义而有的基础共识。抛弃了即自绝于民，无论主张什么均失去一切有意义的前途。", "char_start": 606, "char_end": 709}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "而它的合理性又保证了这个所有人都必须作为起点的地方本身不是一个糟糕的绝境，而是一落地就有一个最基本的、足以保证民族总体生存、社会基本安宁的起码的合理性。", "char_start": 710, "char_end": 786}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "从这往下，没有机会；从这往上，你们各自努力，只有一种可行和另一种可行的区别，没有可行与不可行的区别。", "char_start": 787, "char_end": 837}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "换句话说，《论语》保证了中国政治生活的底线，而这个底线经过两千年的验证，被证实至少高于两千年生存考验的要求。", "char_start": 838, "char_end": 892}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "它是典型的“恰到好处的简洁”——话既没含糊到没有意义，以至于对应对毫无帮助；也没有清晰到把你僵死，以至于你无法应对未知的挑战。", "char_start": 893, "char_end": 956}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "“它到底是什么意思”，只是蕴含在这个载体里的一种游戏，一种利用群体智能、思想竞争来寻求当前局部可用解的算法。所有被这个问题诱惑而抒发的人都形成了一个竞争性的数据，而历史就是这场“思想演化”的选择动力。", "char_start": 957, "char_end": 1057}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "今天适合长脖子的生存，那么长脖子派就会是“对的”；明天适合短脖子生存，那么短脖子派就会是“对的”。并不因为今天长脖子派对过，将来它就不会被证明是“错的”，也不因为它曾经“错”过，它将来就不会再对了。", "char_start": 1058, "char_end": 1157}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这就像曾经被“淘汰”的物种，等到环境重现，又会重新演化出来一样。", "char_start": 1158, "char_end": 1190}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "而上面问了这一句、顿了这一顿，在评论区里呈现出的种种答案和讨论，正是一场活生生的实验。", "char_start": 1191, "char_end": 1234}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这就是中国两千年的文化史、政治史的小样（sample）。", "char_start": 1235, "char_end": 1263}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "《论语》的水平，并不在于它的“意思”，而在于这个巧妙的“你说我是什么意思”的游戏。", "char_start": 1264, "char_end": 1305}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "不是那些意思本身有巨大的价值，而是它通过这巧妙内蕴的三要素所诱发的这个良性的“游戏”有着生死攸关的价值。", "char_start": 1306, "char_end": 1358}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "要说几句这样浅白的话，小学生就可以。", "char_start": 1359, "char_end": 1377}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "要让这几句浅白的话构成一个可以玩两千年、玩出56个民族14亿人不灭之国的游戏，才是它让人望而兴叹之处。", "char_start": 1378, "char_end": 1429}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "不要搞错了方向。", "char_start": 1430, "char_end": 1438}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "所以，答案是什么呢？", "char_start": 1439, "char_end": 1449}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你们都对，你们也都不对，你们在你们对的时候就会对，对方在ta们对的时候对。", "char_start": 1450, "char_end": 1487}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "ta们会在你们错的时候保证你们这整个大家族至少还有一个分支是对的，你们也会在ta们错的时候保证家族里至少还有一个是对的。", "char_start": 1488, "char_end": 1548}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "你们没有全错，你们就可以活。", "char_start": 1549, "char_end": 1563}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "重要的是两者是一家。", "char_start": 1564, "char_end": 1574}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "下次与人相争，好好的想明白这句话。", "char_start": 1575, "char_end": 1592}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 41}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0118"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：你们有没有觉得《论语》其实很肤浅?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040"], "summary": "作者围绕“论语”展开正文论述；此为原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核深化。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出或陈述：“学而时习之，不亦说乎？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文论述。", "其余推理步骤待逐段独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["正文论证、事实依据与概念边界需独立复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "学而时习之，不亦说乎？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动的最低限度初读记录；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b1d8f5cf-6a14-5d90-bfe8-7dbfb0f88a80", "source_ordinal": 3340, "reading_ordinal": 712, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "征求建议", "published_at": "2021-05-08T20:20:04+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/29341706/answer/1875474082"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "第一，负起自己对自己的全部责任，豁免对方一切可能因这建议导致的责任。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "为什么人家宁可眼看着你朝着南墙撞过去，一言不发？", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "因为以你的水平，帮你躲了这道墙，你铁定会在不久的将来撞到下一道墙。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而在你的视角看来，这个故事是什么呢？", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是那个所谓的第一道墙根本不存在，只是个“为了榨取感激的忽悠”，让你头破血流的这个才是第一道墙——“你早就死了，你是你哥哥。”", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 175}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "综合下来的直接总结是——我听了你的，“结果”很倒霉。", "char_start": 176, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "人家给你个建议，尤其是重要的建议，“结果”要算到哪一年为止啊，哥？要是要算到2100年，这个真的帮不了。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "按你这算法，是要一个建议直接送你成为地球之主、文成武德、一统江湖吗？", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这个要求嘛，老朽无能，少侠请继续笔直往前飞，谢谢。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "第二，看准人。", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 324}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "问问题，怎么问，问谁，在什么地方问，大有学问。", "char_start": 325, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "比如不要问路边大妈今年高考录取允不允许改志愿。大妈告诉你可以，你能认定就是可以吗？", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 390}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不要问同学你有没有抑郁症，他说你有，你能认定这说明你有吗？", "char_start": 391, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "不要问取款大厅里取钱的人利率是多少。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 439}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这些人有没有经验？有。", "char_start": 440, "char_end": 451}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "能不能这么问？不能。", "char_start": 452, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "第三，如果你不准备接受自己觉得不对的答案，那就不要问。", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "把所有觉得对的办法都试过了怎么都不行于是跑出来问，而别人说一个你觉得不对的办法，你又要打要杀。", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你觉得对的办法你都试过了，大哥。", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 555}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你难道还没想明白那办法完全可能是你之前觉得不对的办法吗？", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 584}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "看清楚，可没说一定就是，但是可不可能？", "char_start": 585, "char_end": 604}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "可能还是不可能？", "char_start": 605, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "如果你觉得不可能，请你回去接着试。", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 631}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "第四，你如果信不过对方是善意的，你就别请。这工作提前做好、想好，不要自己请了，人家来了又要怀疑人家的善意。", "char_start": 633, "char_end": 686}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "就算人家不是善意的，你也要千金买马骨。", "char_start": 687, "char_end": 706}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "否则所有打算回答你的人都不清楚自己到底算不算善意，兔死狐悲。", "char_start": 707, "char_end": 737}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "无论人家回答什么，只要是应你邀请来答，你一律都要谢谢。", "char_start": 738, "char_end": 765}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你不想一律谢谢，你就不要站在大马路上贴告示征答，你这不叫求问，你这叫挖坑害人。", "char_start": 766, "char_end": 805}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "第五，你是问问题的，你没得到好的答案，只有一种解释，就是你没问好。", "char_start": 806, "char_end": 839}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "是你没问好，导致别人没答好。", "char_start": 840, "char_end": 854}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "不论这是不是实情，这对你就是唯一的解释。", "char_start": 855, "char_end": 875}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "不要挑剔对方的答案，挑剔自己的问题。", "char_start": 876, "char_end": 894}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你不是一个考官，要根据别人的回答决定别人评几级，那是你在学校作为学生学会的问答模式。在真实的世界里，你不是个考官，人家也不是等着你打分的学生。", "char_start": 895, "char_end": 966}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "尤其是手里有真实经验的人，在他们眼里满坑满谷都是等着救命的迷茫小白，是你等着救命，不是人家要抢着救你。", "char_start": 967, "char_end": 1018}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "你在挑剔答案之前不先挑剔自己的问题，说明你水喝得还不够，还有气扑腾。", "char_start": 1019, "char_end": 1053}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "那你就再扑腾几下，再喝几口。", "char_start": 1054, "char_end": 1068}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "喝够了再说。", "char_start": 1069, "char_end": 1075}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "（未完，待续）", "char_start": 1076, "char_end": 1083}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 39}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0118"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何从有经验的人那里征求建议？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038"], "summary": "作者围绕“征求建议”展开正文论述；此为原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核深化。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出或陈述：“第一，负起自己对自己的全部责任，豁免对方一切可能因这建议导致的责任。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文论述。", "其余推理步骤待逐段独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["正文论证、事实依据与概念边界需独立复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "第一，负起自己对自己的全部责任，豁免对方一切可能因这建议导致的责任。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 34, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动的最低限度初读记录；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b5f5c408-4f06-5d86-9ee2-27208d34e966", "source_ordinal": 3339, "reading_ordinal": 713, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "意识上传", "published_at": "2021-05-08T21:37:49+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/419475427/answer/1875579544"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不能。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 3}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "而且道理非常的简单。", "char_start": 4, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你能把一个球形烧瓶里的水，装进一个锥形烧瓶吗？", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "——当然可以啊。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "真的可以吗？", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "水分子的关系还一致吗？", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 66}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你的意识是那个形状、那个水分子的结构关系，不是那些氢氧原子。", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我们举个非常现实的概念——假设一下你的手断了。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "日疼夜疼，痛不欲生。你总是想要伸手去拿饭碗，才发现拿一个空。穿一件衣服，也要求人。于是“我残废了”，这个念头从出事那天起就像一块石头压在面团上那样压在你的意识上，一天比一天嵌得深。半年以后，你变成了一个平静的手残缺者，别人都说你和以前一样，但是你知道，你完全变了一个人。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你的意识与你这个身体是绑定的，看懂了吗？", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 278}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "它就是装在你这个“容器”里的水，但要紧的不是它的重量、味道、化学成分，而是它的“形状”。这“形状”不是几何形状，而是一种逻辑的构造。但这个逻辑的构造是与它所在的容器完全绑定的。", "char_start": 279, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "切掉一只手，它也会变，不是少掉一块脑它才会变。得了过敏，它也会变。一看见ta留下的东西就会心揪紧到喘不过气，它也会变。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "如果把这半年的适应过程取消，直接在一夜之间完成，你的意识就会因为巨大的惯性而自我“断裂”。", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你见过断了两条腿无法接受而自杀的人吧？", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "见过失恋无法接受而自杀的人吧？", "char_start": 494, "char_end": 509}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而所谓的意识上传所造成的冲击远非断两条腿或者失个恋可以比。", "char_start": 510, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "它更像是将一缕青烟从包围它的里“拿”出来，放进另一道风里去，而指望在这个过程中这缕烟不受损。", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 586}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "人的意识与大脑结构不是分离的、独立的存在。它不是“寄生在结构中的模式”，那不是个“寄生关系”。", "char_start": 587, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "它是一个特定硬件的特定运行状态，那个运行状态只能在那个硬件上运行。", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 668}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "举个浅显的例子，一个三灯信号系统，现在AB亮C暗，你想要“上传”这个运行状态，能接受的的硬件载体必须有ABC三个灯。", "char_start": 669, "char_end": 727}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你弄个只有两个灯的线路，你无法移上去。", "char_start": 728, "char_end": 747}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你的线路只有三个灯，这三个灯连接方式不一样，你只是把“AB亮C暗”作为相同起始态移过去，一按运行键，你自己估计一下是什么结果。", "char_start": 748, "char_end": 811}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "喷一挡风玻璃。", "char_start": 812, "char_end": 819}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "给你们留一线希望：", "char_start": 821, "char_end": 830}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "人要能制造出与你的大脑完全一模一样的大脑——所谓一模一样，不是指机箱里的零件型号一模一样，而是指是指从硬盘到内存、到每一个磁道、每一个逻辑门的状态都完全一致，这个时候，就像两辆平行并列飞驰的列车，打开门，你可以走过去。", "char_start": 831, "char_end": 940}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "但这方法，实际上就是直接量子级复刻一个你。", "char_start": 941, "char_end": 962}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "然后把原来的你抽冷子毙了。", "char_start": 963, "char_end": 976}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这是逻辑上唯一的等效实现“意识传送”的办法。", "char_start": 977, "char_end": 999}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "其它的办法，装进去的那个与从你这里取出来的这个无关。", "char_start": 1000, "char_end": 1026}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "“大郎，都弄好了，天黑请闭眼。”", "char_start": 1028, "char_end": 1044}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "关于人的意识完好性与人的身体的绑定关系，我们再来点简单直接的关系——", "char_start": 1046, "char_end": 1080}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "比如你小时候令你印象深刻的牙疼，你想起来就会觉得心有余悸。", "char_start": 1081, "char_end": 1110}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "现在我们假设你能上传而且上传完毕了，现在对你而言“牙疼”是什么？“心有余悸”是什么？", "char_start": 1111, "char_end": 1153}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "牙疼是怎么被数字化的？如何确定这是正确的数字化？把另一个人的牙疼采集数据输入你的意识，谁能确保这是两种相同的牙疼？如果不能，你如何保证上传前采集的这个“牙疼数据”在上传后被还原成了相同的牙疼？", "char_start": 1154, "char_end": 1250}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "再来一条，对你最喜欢的音乐，采集数据的时候采集什么呢？采集它的乐谱，还是采集它的MP3格式音频？只要把这MP3文件放到相同的“文件夹”就可以了吗？是这样吗？", "char_start": 1251, "char_end": 1329}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "它为什么是你最喜欢的音乐？哦你开始讲故事——因为当时你刚高考落榜准备去跳楼，在路上是这曲子救了你的命。那么高考落榜悲痛欲死的感受真的是可以从这曲子里剥离掉，只要放首MP3进去就可以了的吗？那揪紧的心脏、被指甲刺破的手心、翻江倒海的胃、踉跄无力的双腿，都是这信息的多余部分？而进一步的，重要的仅仅是那些感受信息，这些器官感受器本身并无意义？", "char_start": 1330, "char_end": 1499}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "如果你没有牙，没有胃，没有腿，没有心，这些“感受”确信还在新的系统里可以起到和老的系统里的相同逻辑功能吗？", "char_start": 1500, "char_end": 1553}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "如何确信？", "char_start": 1554, "char_end": 1559}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "人对客观存在是绝对无知的。人类根本不可能像了解自己设计的机器一样彻底地了解人类自身，这一点是由自指性在逻辑上绝对地锁死的。", "char_start": 1560, "char_end": 1621}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "人类的文明没有可能进展到能【完全理解】人类文明自身的程度，这是逻辑的不可能。一个人自己也不可能进展到完全理解自己。", "char_start": 1622, "char_end": 1679}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "你根本就没有任何足以说明“实验成功”的鉴定方法。而且这不是什么技术水平问题，是逻辑上原则性的不可能。", "char_start": 1680, "char_end": 1730}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "一切关于“意识上传”的幻想都只能是幻想。", "char_start": 1731, "char_end": 1751}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "“意识上传”就是一种毁灭，再加上一种以被毁灭的为原料的制造。", "char_start": 1752, "char_end": 1782}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "其本质和把牛杀了做了一道红烧牛腩没什么区别。", "char_start": 1783, "char_end": 1805}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "让我把这事换一个角度表述一遍，你们可能会更清楚为什么“意识上传”是不可能的。", "char_start": 1806, "char_end": 1844}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "当我对你说“棒棒糖”，你会接收到“棒棒糖”的音符和字形，对吧？然后你的大脑会经过一番处理，“理解”这些声音震动或视觉符号的具体指向——一个叫做“棒棒糖”的概念。", "char_start": 1845, "char_end": 1925}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "现在的一个关键的问题是——我大脑里的“棒棒糖”这个概念的准确含义，是我所作为标准采样的一组棒棒糖的抽象属性的集合，你的则在原则上也没有本质的区别。", "char_start": 1926, "char_end": 1999}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "问题是，我的棒棒糖标准数据库与你的基本不重合，里面装着的几百种被认定为棒棒糖的采样与你的根本就不一样。", "char_start": 2000, "char_end": 2051}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "基于我对棒棒糖的认知维度与你的差异，我们的棒棒糖概念所附属的属性集本身就是不同的，你可能有颜色、硬度、味道、气味、造型；我可能还有酒精度、油脂度、溶解度、刚性、屈服点。", "char_start": 2052, "char_end": 2136}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "如果我们把这个概念表达为一张表单，那么我们不但在相同的格子里填写的内容不同，我们的格子数量、格子类型也互相不重合——甚至如果你认识到每个格子的标签本身也是一个概念，而这个不重合效应是递归的，你就会意识到——事实上我们的这两张表单上没有任何部分在严格意义上是一致的。", "char_start": 2137, "char_end": 2269}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "换句话来说，想要参考你的大脑的结构里关于棒棒糖的具体记录，来推定我的大脑里的类似结构就是“棒棒糖”，在原则上就是绝对无效的。", "char_start": 2270, "char_end": 2332}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "并且，你也不可能通过调查全部的地球人类的“棒棒糖”概念的记录样式，来断言任何一个特定人的某个样式的构造是否代表“棒棒糖”。", "char_start": 2333, "char_end": 2394}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "因为你将无法发现任何有足够意义的共性。", "char_start": 2395, "char_end": 2414}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "所有人的意识都是基于完全私有的成长过程，循着完全私有的训练集，自发形成完全私有的存储协议，存储在完全独特发育的硬件基础上的。", "char_start": 2415, "char_end": 2477}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "一个人的记忆、意识事实上处在无限复杂的加密算法的保护之中。因为你的大脑的概念/构造/功能的形成甚至与你所经历的事件的输入顺序有关。", "char_start": 2478, "char_end": 2543}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "如果把一个人的“机器码”列出来，用另一个人的“编译器“去解读，将不会得到任何有意义的读取结果。", "char_start": 2544, "char_end": 2591}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "注意，是任何的两个人之间都是如此。", "char_start": 2592, "char_end": 2609}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "把你的“棒棒糖”的编码（姑且假设我们跳过这读取的困难做到了这个奇迹）直接写入到另一个“空白大脑”——说实话这不知道到底是个什么概念，一个终身昏睡状态发育出来的大脑？这大脑怕是连沟回都没有分化——得到的结果根本就不会是“棒棒糖”，甚至根本不会是任何有意义的信息，而是在极大的几率上得到完全没有任何有效意义的乱码。", "char_start": 2610, "char_end": 2765}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "你根本无法实现“读取”，你的“写入”根本没有意义。", "char_start": 2766, "char_end": 2791}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "body", "index": 60, "text": "所以，唯一可行的就是在无法破解加密的前提下进行“绝对复制”。把每一个突触、每一个受体、每一个细节都照样复制。", "char_start": 2792, "char_end": 2846}, {"paragraph_id": "P061", "field": "body", "index": 61, "text": "你不能用硅基半导体加金属这种物质基础、以自认为“功能相同”的构造，去绝对复制另一个人的大脑，因为仅仅这个材质不同已经是不可接受的本质不同。这就像你用纯铜做一双AJ运动鞋，形状完全一模一样，精确到微米，你却根本不能指望前者和后者“一样”一样——你不会穿着它去打球。", "char_start": 2847, "char_end": 2978}, {"paragraph_id": "P062", "field": "body", "index": 62, "text": "如果要打个比方，可以说一个人的意识和另一个人的意识的关系，非常类似一个文明和另一个文明的关系。", "char_start": 2979, "char_end": 3026}, {"paragraph_id": "P063", "field": "body", "index": 63, "text": "彼此语言完全不同、价值观有巨大的差异、行为准则、行事逻辑、审美倾向、对特定概念的理解……其差异之大，很容易让人意识到它是不可能通过抽象的方式来达成一致的。", "char_start": 3027, "char_end": 3104}, {"paragraph_id": "P064", "field": "body", "index": 64, "text": "说英语的人是不可能在没有英汉字典存在的前提下，靠阅读一个中国人的自传来“正确读取”一个中国人的一生的。", "char_start": 3105, "char_end": 3156}, {"paragraph_id": "P065", "field": "body", "index": 65, "text": "更不用说这个中国人自己用自己的意识写下来的这本自传，根本就不是ta自己意识的全部内容。", "char_start": 3157, "char_end": 3200}, {"paragraph_id": "P066", "field": "body", "index": 66, "text": "换句话来说，人的意识是绝对黑箱，“读取意识”这个操作根本就没有可行的技术路线可用。", "char_start": 3201, "char_end": 3242}, {"paragraph_id": "P067", "field": "body", "index": 67, "text": "挡住它的是人类认知方式本身所固有的逻辑限制，这是无可超越的东西。", "char_start": 3243, "char_end": 3275}, {"paragraph_id": "P068", "field": "body", "index": 68, "text": "更不用说如果实现了这种“读取”技术，仅仅这技术本身就足以使人类社会的组织结构、伦理法则都失去可行性，作为集体的人类本身将不复存在。", "char_start": 3276, "char_end": 3341}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 71}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0118"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：「意识上传」是否可以实现，以什么技术方式实现？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060", "P061", "P062", "P063", "P064", "P065", "P066", "P067", "P068"], "summary": "作者围绕“意识上传”展开正文论述；此为原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核深化。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出或陈述：“不能。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文论述。", "其余推理步骤待逐段独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["正文论证、事实依据与概念边界需独立复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不能。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 3, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动的最低限度初读记录；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "63757d4e-e82f-5668-a913-d045fd50b67d", "source_ordinal": 3338, "reading_ordinal": 714, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "斗争", "published_at": "2021-05-09T02:24:07+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/458339996/answer/1875889012"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“男女对立问题“是一个伪问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为男女逻辑上无法对立，对立人类就毁灭了。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果你一定要这么看的话，实际上是一部分男性和女性生活在支持“延续男权”的社群里（姑且以“强男”称呼），一部分男性和女性生活在支持“女权”的社群里（姑且以“强女”称呼），还有一部分男性和女性生活在中间地带。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "从人群分布上看，第一群、第二群加起来恐怕还没有第三群的十分之一多。多为婚龄、恋龄的单身青年和青春期少年男女。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "从态度上看，强男社群可能误以为沉默的大多数在自己这一边，所以憋着要凭借强大的“实力收复失地”。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "强女社群则误以为沉默的多数站在对方那边下所以要绝地反攻。", "char_start": 244, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但是事实上第三群甚至连中立都算不上，只是默默的置身事外，按照每一个家庭自己的选择，或者既说不清是不是男权，也说不清是不是女权的日子。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 339}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "一天一天过，直到过不下去。", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 353}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "过不下去的部分原因从表象上看似乎是一方听信了男权/女权的“蛊惑”“导致家庭失和”。但事实上那个矛盾鲜少真的与男权与女权有关，而只是将某种关系失调找了这个借口和形式发做出来了——阴影的一方既不清楚这两者的确切理念，也不在乎和追求自己同性的集体权益，甚至根本就不认为存在一个男性同盟、或者女性同盟。", "char_start": 354, "char_end": 501}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "说白了，现在在互联网上声量极大的所谓“男权”和“女权”，绝大多数只是逼真的cosplay，将自己的困境归结于性别符号，对着虚空的敌人无意义的挥舞拳头、虚掷着自己的资源和体力罢了。", "char_start": 502, "char_end": 591}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "所以，这两方几乎从来不关心自己做的是不是正确、谁是敌人、谁是盟友、什么是战斗的手段。", "char_start": 592, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "作为这种不在乎的证据，就是暴力的普遍滥用。", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 656}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不错，没有拳脚相向，但是言辞的无礼和刻薄，心态的敌意和仇恨隔着十里地就看得到火光直冲斗牛。", "char_start": 657, "char_end": 702}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "争权力和争权利是不同的。", "char_start": 703, "char_end": 715}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "如果你是依靠暴力成功，你的成功就是暴力的成功，你的成功只不过是对方没有长大和你没有病倒之前的短暂蜜月罢了。", "char_start": 716, "char_end": 769}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "人们总是误以为这种权力斗争就是斗争的全部，所以只专注在暴力上。", "char_start": 770, "char_end": 801}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "殊不知，手握暴力的优势根本不表示你赢了，而是表示你获得了准考资格。", "char_start": 802, "char_end": 835}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "接下来你掌握着制定规则、划定权利的主动，而这是一个非暴力的阶段。", "char_start": 836, "char_end": 868}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "如果你划分得好，给了世界渴望和该有的平衡——注意，那绝不是什么你独家吃饱、“战败者”含恨饿死的所谓“平衡”——那么你将获得长久得多的许可，作为新秩序的缔造者和守护者而得到双方的承认——尤其是战败方的承认。", "char_start": 869, "char_end": 971}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "换句话来说，真正的胜利，在于你获得暴力的暂时胜利之后的那个阶段。那个你明明有暴力的优势，但却能退后一步，容对方获得足够满意的，足够ta们认为继续斗争不再必要的权利的阶段。", "char_start": 972, "char_end": 1057}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "那个非暴力的阶段。", "char_start": 1058, "char_end": 1067}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "那才是你的大考，而且是有交卷期限的大考。", "char_start": 1068, "char_end": 1088}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "李自成坐进过考场，考得稀巴烂，卷子都没写完就被赶出去了，落发割袍，亡命山野。", "char_start": 1089, "char_end": 1127}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "蒙古人坐进过考场，雄霸天下，蒙古人还没挺到一百年，被追亡逐北，退回苦寒之地。", "char_start": 1128, "char_end": 1166}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "项羽坐进过考场，十面楚歌，乌江自刎。", "char_start": 1167, "char_end": 1185}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "不是你的霸道让你取胜，而是你的德行才让人俯首称臣。", "char_start": 1186, "char_end": 1211}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "为什么说现在的所谓“男女对立”是cosplay的闹剧？", "char_start": 1212, "char_end": 1239}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "因为正规作战的部队，开战之前就写好了停战条约，战就是为了按自己的版本和。", "char_start": 1240, "char_end": 1276}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "如果这条约写得够好，对方会直接放下武器——你肯给的我恰好便要，还打什么打？", "char_start": 1277, "char_end": 1314}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这条约要写得差……呵呵，你有种灭绝了我们，否则随你有多强，我们不可能停止战斗，因为退无可退——你永无“胜利”可言。", "char_start": 1315, "char_end": 1372}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "而这双方的条约呢？", "char_start": 1373, "char_end": 1382}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "没有条约，就是打假球。", "char_start": 1383, "char_end": 1394}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "如果是民族矛盾，也许你还可以指望把对方消灭干净。", "char_start": 1395, "char_end": 1419}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "性别矛盾，你们怎么打算怎么消灭掉敌人？", "char_start": 1420, "char_end": 1439}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "你们知道为什么沉默的大多数为什么不关心、只是拿这些在趁手的时候当吵嘴借口了吗？", "char_start": 1440, "char_end": 1479}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "因为你们只是在胡闹。", "char_start": 1480, "char_end": 1490}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "打什么打？先写好条约。", "char_start": 1491, "char_end": 1502}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "如果你暂时取胜了，你打算【让】给对方什么？你觉得要【让】出什么，能让对方觉得继续斗争将没有足够的同盟？", "char_start": 1504, "char_end": 1555}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "你们是中国人，是天生的外交家和政治家后代，继承了三千年不绝于书的文明史，这应该是你们的种族天赋，普遍常识。", "char_start": 1557, "char_end": 1610}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "但你们却在打这种过家家的泥巴仗，有的人还往里掺尿混屎，以“加强威力”。", "char_start": 1611, "char_end": 1646}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "丢不丢人？羞不羞？", "char_start": 1647, "char_end": 1656}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "想赢，就说清楚你赢了会【让】给对方什么？", "char_start": 1658, "char_end": 1678}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "heading", "index": 43, "text": "你准备【让】什么？", "char_start": 1679, "char_end": 1688}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 45, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0118"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎样看待网络上的男女对立问题？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043"], "summary": "作者围绕“斗争”展开正文论述；此为原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核深化。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出或陈述：““男女对立问题“是一个伪问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文论述。", "其余推理步骤待逐段独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["正文论证、事实依据与概念边界需独立复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“男女对立问题“是一个伪问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动的最低限度初读记录；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c7036a34-fad7-5be8-bb58-2f76883b549e", "source_ordinal": 3337, "reading_ordinal": 715, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "自私", "published_at": "2021-05-09T10:37:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/431193864/answer/1876178133"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "问题从来就不是自私，而是愚蠢。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "把所有的东西都扒拉到自己碗里，这问题不是自私，而是愚蠢。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "其它的人是你的资产，远比你碗里的那点饭更重要的资产，没有ta们根本就不会存在可以扒的饭。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不要批评“自私”，自私根本就没有错，", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "要批评愚蠢。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "永远不要批评人自私。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "人的自私，是一种就算全世界人反对，也无法放弃的权利。", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "所以批评自私是无效的，视自私为罪甚至是残忍的。", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而恰恰相反，愚蠢，是一种就算全世界的法律都不责怪，但人自己却不可以容忍。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "自己纵容自己愚蠢，就是对自己犯罪。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 233}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0118"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：请问一个普通人应该多自私才合适？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "作者围绕“自私”展开正文论述；此为原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核深化。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出或陈述：“问题从来就不是自私，而是愚蠢。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文论述。", "其余推理步骤待逐段独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["正文论证、事实依据与概念边界需独立复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "问题从来就不是自私，而是愚蠢。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动的最低限度初读记录；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
